  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-3": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-3.opus",
  "ああ、佐藤さんです。IMCの人ですよ。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-3.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-4.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-4.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-4": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-4.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-4": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-4.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-5.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-5.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-5": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-5.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-5": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-5.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-6.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-6.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-6": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-6.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-6": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-6.opus",
  "眼鏡をかけている人です。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-6.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-7.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-7.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-7": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-7.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-7": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-7.opus",
  "ああ、ワットさんです。さくら大学の先生ですよ。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-7.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-8.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-8.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-8": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-8.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-8": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-8.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-9.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-9.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-9": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-9.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-9": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-9.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-10.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-10.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-10": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-10.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-10": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-10.opus",
  "白いシャツを着ている人です。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-10.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-11.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-11.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-ii-11": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-11.opus",
  "l22-scene-ii-11": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-11.opus",
  "ああ、松本さんです。IMCの部長ですよ。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-ii-11.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-iii-0.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-iii-0.opus",
  "mnn-1:l22-scene-iii-0": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-iii-0.opus",
  "田中さんにもらったカタログはどこにありますか。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-1/l22-scene-iii-0.opus",
