  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-2.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-2.opus",
  "mnn-2:l40-scene-iv-2": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-2.opus",
  "l40-scene-iv-2": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-2.opus",
  "とても楽しいですよ。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-2.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-3.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-3.opus",
  "mnn-2:l40-scene-iv-3": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-3.opus",
  "l40-scene-iv-3": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-3.opus",
  "そうですか。ぜひ一度行ってみたいです。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l40-scene-iv-3.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-0.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-0.opus",
  "mnn-2:l41-scene-i-0": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-0.opus",
  "l41-scene-i-0": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-0.opus",
  "ワットさん、いずみさん、ご結婚 おめでとう ございます。乾杯。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-0.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-1.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-1.opus",
  "mnn-2:l41-scene-i-1": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-1.opus",
  "l41-scene-i-1": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l41-scene-i-1.opus",
