  "mnn-2:l42-scene-i-2": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-2.opus",
  "l42-scene-i-2": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-2.opus",
  "あしたです。楽しみですね。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-2.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-3.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-3.opus",
  "mnn-2:l42-scene-i-3": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-3.opus",
  "l42-scene-i-3": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-3.opus",
  "ええ。鈴木さんは何に使いますか。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-3.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-4.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-4.opus",
  "mnn-2:l42-scene-i-4": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-4.opus",
  "l42-scene-i-4": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-4.opus",
  "まず新しい自転車を買って、それから旅行に行って……。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-4.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-5.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-5.opus",
  "mnn-2:l42-scene-i-5": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-5.opus",
  "l42-scene-i-5": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-5.opus",
  "貯金はしないんですか。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-5.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-6.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-6.opus",
