  "l42-scene-i-6": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-6.opus",
  "僕はあまり考えたこと、ありませんね。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-6.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-7.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-7.opus",
  "mnn-2:l42-scene-i-7": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-7.opus",
  "l42-scene-i-7": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-7.opus",
  "わたしは半分は貯金するつもりです。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-7.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-8.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-8.opus",
  "mnn-2:l42-scene-i-8": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-8.opus",
  "l42-scene-i-8": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-8.opus",
  "えっ、半分も貯金するんですか。": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-8.opus",
  "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-9.opus": "/audio/books/dialogues/mnn-2/l42-scene-i-9.opus",
